==Spanish==

===Etymology===
Vulgar Latin ''*accordare'', from [[cor]] ‘heart’.

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|/akoɾˈdaɾ/}}

===Verb===
'''acordar'''

# {{transitive|lang=es}} to [[decide]], to [[arrange]]
# {{intransitive|lang=es}} to [[agree]]
# {{reflexive|lang=es}} to reach agreement
# {{reflexive|lang=es}} to [[remember]], [[recall]]

